      "title": "Modes and Modal Transposition",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** transposition | **Difficulty:** 7/10 | **Time:** ~8 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Modal transposition preserves characteristic altered scale degrees, not just letter names."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "key-signatures",
      "title": "Key signatures",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "D dorian shares C major's signature. G mixolydian shares C major's signature. D major has two sharps — different collection."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "preserving-colour",
      "title": "Preserving colour",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Transposing D mixolydian to E mixolydian: keep the flat 7th (D natural in E mixolydian). Dorian keeps major 6th; mixolydian keeps flat 7th."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
